  <item>
    <title>5. 地狱马拉松・续二：吴京叔叔再来信、汪小姐最起码应该是听枪花的《十一月的雨》和红房哥哥说他被美女包围了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665341b34efbc0c3dc2bf9f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665341b34efbc0c3dc2bf9f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 14:05:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《town-B radio》是一档只对谈话人的交流快感负责的音乐聊天节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>姗姗剪迟的二月录音下半场，大伙儿继续聊2023年听过的印象深刻的非2023年出品。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主题：</span></strong><span><br>中国地偶的有趣现象<br>黑人白人是一家<br>吴京叔叔再来信<br>一首好歌永流传<br>坎爷早期日版遗珠和迷惑当下<br>巴西老乡一JAM就好听到没办法<br>我们都爱模仿Barrington Levy<br>上海人小明为什么不看《繁花》<br>外语系毕业的汪小姐最起码应该是听枪花的《十一月的雨》<br>上海曾无限接近欧洲一线城市<br>红房哥哥说他被美女包围了</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>谈话人：</span></strong><span>耳田 a.k.a. mimida/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6074f1f632a9048b0b89d16c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6074f1f632a9048b0b89d16c"><span>redhousepainter</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65890c9a1bee258b2a4bea0f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65890c9a1bee258b2a4bea0f"><span>陆晓明</span></a><span>/老几林（</span><a href="https://site.douban.com/ddm/" data-url="https://site.douban.com/ddm/"><span>DDM</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐片段：</span></strong><span><br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a> Laura Nyro ft Labelle - The Bells<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> The Five Stairsteps - O-o-h Child<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> Laura Nyro - O-o-h Child</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a> Freddie McGregor - O-o-h Child<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 2Pac - Keep Ya Head Up<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">18:36</a> Kanye West - Bittersweet Poetry<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1504">25:04</a> Nina Simone - Mr. Bojangles<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">30:42</a> Gilberto Gil &amp; Jorge Ben - Taj Mahal<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a> Rod Stewart - Do Ya Think I'm Sexy<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2179">36:19</a> Barrington Levy - The Vibes Is Right<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">14:01</a> Ernie K-Doe - Te-ta-Te-ta-Ta<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3194">53:14</a> Milla - Respira Fundo (acústico)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3338">55:38</a> Milla - Respira Fundo<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3472">57:52</a> 徐明智, 徐晨 - 白字经（宁夏小曲/宁夏坐唱）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>由于时间关系最终没能塞进去的预选歌曲：</span></strong><span><br>耳田：水曜日のカンパネ - Monopoly、佚明 - Mon Chocolat<br>redhousepainter：Pure Silk - What You Do for Me、Mica Paris &nbsp;- I Wanna Hold On to You<br>陆晓明：Sleep Walker - Reminiscenece、Jaga Jazzist and English orchestra Britten Sinfonia - Music! Dance! Drama!<br>老几林：（无）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的书：</span></strong><span>金宇澄《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/22714154/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/22714154/"><span>繁花</span></a><span>》（2013）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的影视作品：</span></strong><span>《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/34874646/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/34874646/"><span>繁花</span></a><span>》（2023）、《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1291999/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1291999/"><span>重庆森林</span></a><span>》（1994）、《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292679/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292679/"><span>春光乍泄</span></a><span>》（1997）、《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1291557/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1291557/"><span>花样年华</span></a><span>》（2000）、《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1291875/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1291875/"><span>阳光灿烂的日子</span></a><span>》（1994）、《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1297880/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1297880/"><span>芙蓉镇</span></a><span>》（1987）、《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/20376577/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/20376577/"><span>小时代</span></a><span>》（2013）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Logo设计：</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c"><span>大胃麒麟</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>合作联系：</span></strong><span>idmimida@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
