  <item>
    <title>4. 地狱马拉松・续一：250探寻韩国土流行、重新发现九〇年代中国本土原创和什么才是中国的“北方灵魂乐”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66531190c59d1e5757c2513e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66531190c59d1e5757c2513e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 10:40:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《town-B radio》是一档只对谈话人的交流快感负责的音乐聊天节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>姗姗剪迟的二月录音，大伙儿聊了聊2023年听过的印象深刻的非2023年出品。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主题：</span></strong><span><br>NewJeans制作人的韩国土味流行乐探寻之旅<br>Diplo对二〇一〇、二〇年代的影响<br>重新发现九〇年代中国本土原创流行乐<br>X峰和X楠：真情和假意？<br>杜德伟当年和西方完全同步<br>林依轮的先天条件和后天追求<br>坂本龙一〜Dick Lee〜张全复：那时大家都在忙着中西融合<br>Mixolydian音阶上的巧妙五声抄袭<br>1995年韩晓的酸性爵士<br>什么是中国的“北方灵魂乐”？<br>从老狼到赵雷到血男孩<br>民谣拼盘里的电气欧珈源<br>小明入坑阵雨电台<br>中国地偶的有趣现象</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>谈话人（按出场顺序）：</span></strong><span>耳田 a.k.a. mimida/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6074f1f632a9048b0b89d16c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6074f1f632a9048b0b89d16c"><span>redhousepainter</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65890c9a1bee258b2a4bea0f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65890c9a1bee258b2a4bea0f"><span>陆晓明</span></a><span>/老几林（</span><a href="https://site.douban.com/ddm/" data-url="https://site.douban.com/ddm/"><span>DDM</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐片段：</span></strong><span><br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">03:57</a> 250 - 사랑이야기 (Love Story)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> 高峰 - 大中国<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">17:07</a> Afrika Bambaataa &amp; Soulsonic Force - Planet Rock<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> 杜德伟 - 拯救地球<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> Clivilles &amp; Cole - A Deeper Love<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a> 林依轮 - 火火的歌谣<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a> 林依轮 - 心动<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a> 林依轮 - 十二座光阴的小城<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">35:18</a> 新空气组合 - 新空气的声音<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a> George Michael - Father Figure<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2533">42:13</a> P.M. Dawn - Looking Though Patient Eyes<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2645">44:05</a> 韩晓 - 我想去桂林<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2848">47:28</a> 韩晓 - 晓晓的小窝<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3034">50:34</a> 赵雷 - 我记得<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3544">59:04</a> 欧珈源 - 疙瘩山<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3829">63:49</a> CHICKEN BLOW THE IDOL - なんて寂しい夜なんだ</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的书：</span></strong><span><br>长谷川町藏+大和田俊之《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35929103/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35929103/"><span>别再问我什么是嘻哈③</span></a><span>》（拜德雅，2023）<br>小林孝行《</span><a href="http://www.genjin.jp/book/b493352.html" data-url="http://www.genjin.jp/book/b493352.html"><span>日韓大衆音楽の社会史: エンカとトロットの土着性と越境性</span></a><span>》（現代人文社，2019）、<br>《</span><a href="https://musicmagazine.stores.jp/items/64ae35c6b4982d002c698e17" data-url="https://musicmagazine.stores.jp/items/64ae35c6b4982d002c698e17"><span>ミュージック・マガジン2023年8月号</span></a><span>》（ミュージック・マガジン，2023）</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的影片：<br>《</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLIl6BrY8eMQxOlrznI7bcqZZMjzoVQjS9" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLIl6BrY8eMQxOlrznI7bcqZZMjzoVQjS9"><span>뽕을 찾아서</span></a><span>》（Finding Ppong）（2018-2023）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Logo设计：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c"><span>大胃麒麟</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>合作联系：idmimida@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqhHfG1bLL6KfDw-Mg4f3rMgTRwG.m4a" length="140612943" type="audio/mp4"/>
