  <item>
    <title>9. Roland SP-404: 嘻哈在左噪音在右——一款采样器的双重人格</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660dcb48c891c06e7332fccc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660dcb48c891c06e7332fccc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 21:34:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《town-B radio》是一档只对谈话人的交流快感负责的音乐聊天节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>说到做到，罗兰SP-404特辑for 404 DAY。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们请到了广东地区beatmaker的代表人物PETECHEN和上海噪音音乐旗手舒骑，让他们来讲讲他们各自与这款号称“全球最流行的便携式采样机”接触的历程和使用心得，带我们一窥这款“lo-fi hip hop名机”在beat making上的优越之处，以及一般人难以想象的非常规操作术。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FihwOlRhc0KGc2hxMa3VvVjicwSL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主题：</span></strong><span><br>SP-404是什么<br>J Dilla、Madlib、L.A. Beat群英的魅惑力<br>404有意为之的RePitch失真？<br>可视化设备V.S.非可视化设备<br>PETECHEN的404、MPC使用心得与比较<br>Lo-fi hip hop和404之间的关系<br>J Dilla《Donuts》作为历史节点<br>404 MKII设计师和Dilla/Madlib的传承关系<br>PETECHEN的404现场操作法<br>MPC的可替代性和新一代的Stems功能<br>iZotope RX的Music Rebalance<br>Beatmaker们各自的采样哲学<br>PETECHEN给入门beatmaker们的建议<br>噪音音乐人为何选择404<br>罗兰公司在音乐理解上的过人之处<br>同样的设备，完全不同的用法<br>舒骑的404噪音音乐现场演示+解说<br>噪音音乐人和DJ在方法论上的相似之处<br>Wack Saturday Records和trigger活动预告</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>谈话人：</span></strong><span>耳田 a.k.a. mimida/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65890c9a1bee258b2a4bea0f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65890c9a1bee258b2a4bea0f"><span>陆小明 a.k.a. Bobby</span></a><span>/PETECHEN (V.N.P Crew/MadPete/nehcetep)/舒骑 a.k.a. Shu Ride</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐片段：</span></strong><span><br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> Teebs - Wind Loop<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> Ras G - Ghetto Sci-Fi<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> ZOMBIE-CHANG - GOODBYE MY LOVE AND TURN AROUND (unkind LIVE 2016)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> 檸檬精 V.N.P Crew - 好驚喜 Skit 1 &amp; 打工仔 Work Process<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> MADPETE - 纸飞机 Paper Plane<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> Chill Terrific &amp; Wootacc - 3000<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1409">23:29</a> PETECHEN - you<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1449">24:09</a> nehcetep - Spring of Rio (nehcetep edited)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">27:42</a> Beat Culture &amp; the SP-404 (Dibia$e, Flying Lotus and Ras G) (ending)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2091">34:51</a> J Dilla - Bye<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2653">44:13</a> MPC Stems out now - MPC Stems Cook up EP 1 (Feat. Marco Polo) (excerpt)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2812">46:52</a> iZotope RX 8 Music Rebalance Demo (excerpt)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3047">50:47</a> Sons Of Kemet - Pick Up Your Burning Cross (ft. Moor Mother, Angel Bat Dawid)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> Dos Monos - 王墓<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3298">54:58</a> Ohbliv - Life Infinite<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3692">61:32</a> Hanzo Hasashi - Kenja No Ishi<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4033">67:13</a> 舒骑 - 噪音音乐现场演示+解说</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的书：</span></strong><span><br>Laurent Fintoni《</span><a href="https://velocitypress.uk/product/bedroom-beats-book/" data-url="https://velocitypress.uk/product/bedroom-beats-book/"><span>Bedroom Beats &amp; B-Sides: Instrumental Hip Hop &amp; Electronic Music at the Turn of the Century</span></a><span>》（Velocity Press, 2020）<br>大島純《</span><a href="https://www.rittor-music.co.jp/product/detail/3117317419/" data-url="https://www.rittor-music.co.jp/product/detail/3117317419/"><span>MPC IMPACT! テクノロジーから読み解くヒップホップ</span></a><span>》（Rittor Music, 2020）<br>长谷川町藏+大和田俊之《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/34986373/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/34986373/"><span>别再问我什么是嘻哈①</span></a><span>》（拜德雅，2020）<br>长谷川町藏+大和田俊之《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35929102/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35929102/"><span>别再问我什么是嘻哈②</span></a><span>》（拜德雅，2023）<br>长谷川町藏+大和田俊之《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35929103/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35929103/"><span>别再问我什么是嘻哈③</span></a><span>》（拜德雅，2023）<br>Dan Charnas《</span><a href="https://dillati.me/" data-url="https://dillati.me/"><span>Dilla Time: The Life and Afterlife of J Dilla, the Hip-Hop Producer Who Reinvented Rhythm</span></a><span>》（2022）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的影片：</span></strong><span><br>《</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SuENbvQ54nY&amp;t" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SuENbvQ54nY&amp;t"><span>Madlib talks Yesterday’s New Quintet, Sampling and Gear</span></a><span>》 (Red Bull Music Academy 2002) <br>Matthew F. Smith《</span><a href="https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x3hfaih" data-url="https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x3hfaih"><span>Looking For The Perfect Beat</span></a><span>》（2013）<br>《</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CDPcmYGPRKA" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CDPcmYGPRKA"><span>Beat Culture &amp; the SP-404 with Dibia$e, Flying Lotus and Ras G</span></a><span>》（2020）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关注Petechen最新动态及活动消息：</span></strong><em><span>WackSaturdayRecords</span></em><span>（公众号）、</span><em><span>EarthGoodGarments地球制衣</span></em><span>（公众号）、workshop视频参见</span><em><span>地球制衣EGGs</span></em><span>（微信视频号）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关注tigger最新动态及演出视频：</span></strong><em><span>trigger切割</span></em><span>（公众号）、</span><em><span>trigger_shanghai</span></em><span>（ins）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Logo设计：</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c"><span>大胃麒麟</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>合作联系：</span></strong><span>idmimida@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>--------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>RolandSP-404系列图鉴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Roland SP-404↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmlhEFRaF3CSnwC9uprQqLpwTd-N.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Roland SP-404SX↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiC2YrsGeigrNBoZ8P31HbUIn7rt.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Roland SP-404A↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjzv6MyRqmzNrlYcLjdiFPF8DnSX.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Roland SP-404MKII↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoEn4kHbfr43K7Q_iMdchYByGOvE.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>罗兰不给我们打赏说不过去了</span></p>]]></description>
