    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《town-B radio》是一档只对谈话人的交流快感负责的音乐聊天节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>上集节目讲完地上，这集继续由SUBJHOP新一任主理人雨田木易子带我们听地下和地方日本嘻哈。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本集主题：</span></strong><span>木木姐的“走出涩谷”计划、木木姐和千叶雄喜的亲密接触、日本才该是rage和plugg的主场、在日韩国说唱歌手、在东京做boom bap的年轻人、不要一提日本嘻哈就是jazzy hip hop和Nujabes、battle MC V.S. 音源系rapper、R-指定竖立的“坏”标准和DJ松永炎上、2023年年度beef、YZERR的问题歌词和东蛋炒作、beef过后大家都是朋友、小学生式歌词其实不容易</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>谈话人（按出场顺序）：</span></strong><span>雨田木易子 a.k.a. Thundersheep/耳田 a.k.a. mimida/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c"><span>大胃麒麟 a.k.a. DVC</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐片段：</span></strong><span><br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> JNKMN &amp; DJ JAM - WASSA (feat. Lunv Loyal)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> Lunv Loyal - SHIBUKI BOY<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> Bleecker Chrome - come again (feat. Sik-K)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">14:27</a> Kamui - Playboi Carti<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a> Only U - DREAM! (feat. LEX)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> Shurkn Pap - 蜜蜂 (feat. tlinh)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> どんぐりず × Neibiss &nbsp;- DOMBIESS<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> lil soft tennis - F***ed Up!!<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> Eric.B.Jr - East River Side (feat. Lil Gori)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1939">32:19</a> Moment Joon &amp; Fisong - Way Back 根&amp;傷<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> Flat Line Classics &nbsp;FLAT LINE CLASSICS<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2468">41:08</a> 百足 &amp; 韻マン - 君のまま<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2603">43:23</a> Fuma no KTR × SKRYU × WAZGOGG - How Many Boogie<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2845">47:25</a> 舐達麻 - FEEL OR BEEF BADPOP IS DEAD<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3216">53:36</a> YZERR - guidance<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3464">57:44</a> 千葉雄喜 - チーム友達</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的日本嘻哈音乐节：</span></strong><a href=" popyours.jp"><span>POP YOURS</span></a><span>、</span><a href="the-hope.jp"><span>THE HOPE</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关注J-HIP HOP最新动态：</span></strong><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6423956168" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6423956168"><span>SUBJHOP微博</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/3pd0saEbBgTShcf6tGrRh2" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/3pd0saEbBgTShcf6tGrRh2"><span>SUBJHOP歌单（Spotify）</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/2409034" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/2409034"><span>雨田木易子B站</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Logo设计：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c"><span>大胃麒麟 a.k.a. DVC</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>合作联系：idmimida@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
