    <title>7. 日本嘻哈现在时（上）：此刻正是重新认识J-Hip Hop的最好时机</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fd72231519139e4ffa2ffd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fd72231519139e4ffa2ffd</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Mar 2024 11:57:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《town-B radio》是一档只对谈话人的交流快感负责的音乐聊天节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2010年代“Dungeon”和freestyle带来的第5次日本说唱热潮彻底消褪，新冠引致的现场停摆也让场景一度沉寂。然而人类以声音为载体的表达欲并不会就此消散，能让最大范畴的群众成为音乐创作者的领域也只会积聚更大的能量。后新冠时代的场景再开，让我们看到又一批有才华的年轻人涌向地上，新的活动和媒介也对场景的结构进行了又一次改造。改朝换代的此刻，正是重新认识日本嘻哈的最好时机，而我们的向导就是——身在现场的SUBJHOP新一任主理人雨田木易子。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本集主题：</span></strong><span>两大日本嘻哈专门音乐节、女性说唱歌手的结盟和不结盟、gal的美甲和假睫毛、TikTok创造流行、说唱歌手世代交替、日式Afro-drill代表人、不会读汉字的说唱歌手和有文化的说唱歌手、2023年最佳punchline......</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>谈话人（按出场顺序）：</span></strong><span>耳田 a.k.a. mimida/雨田木易子 a.k.a. Thundersheep/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c"><span>大胃麒麟 a.k.a. DVC</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐片段：</span></strong><span><br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a> SugLawd Familiar, CHICO CARLITO, Awich - LONGINESS REMIX<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> Awich, NENE, LANA, MaRI, AI &amp; YURIYAN RETRIEVER - Bad B*tch 美学 Remix<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> Bonbero, LANA, MFS, Watson - Makuhari<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a> LANA - PULL UP<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a> kZm - DOSHABURI feat. JUMADIBA<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2146">35:46</a> ralph - Get Back (feat. JUMADIBA &amp; Watson)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2468">41:08</a> Watson - Working Class Anthem (feat. eyden)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> JJJ - Eye Splice<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2797">46:37</a> Mall Boyz (Tohji &amp; gummyboy) - Do u remember me<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3249">54:09</a> ゆるふわギャング (Yurufuwa Gang) - Ms.Groove &amp; Mr.Freaky<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> Candee - Candemic<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3729">62:09</a> guca owl - DIFFICULT<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4008">66:48</a> Skaai - PRO<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4212">70:12</a> Yo-Sea - Moonlight<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4478">74:38</a> CreativeDrugStore (VaVa, BIM, JUBEE, in-d) - 6ix Pack<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4756">79:16</a> Elle Teresa - Nail Sounds<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5064">84:24</a> 7 - Boss B*tch Remix (feat. LANA &amp; Elle Teresa)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5338">88:58</a> IO - Tokyo Freeway (feat. KEIJU)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的日本嘻哈音乐节：</span></strong><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/65bea7cc513a776b57f61dab/create/popyours.jp" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/65bea7cc513a776b57f61dab/create/popyours.jp"><span>POP YOURS</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/65bea7cc513a776b57f61dab/create/the-hope.jp" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/65bea7cc513a776b57f61dab/create/the-hope.jp"><span>THE HOPE</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的电影：</span></strong><span>《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/26366454/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/26366454/"><span>THE COCKPIT</span></a><span>》（2015）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的综艺节目：</span></strong><span>《Show Me The Money》（2012-2022）、《ラップスタア誕生!》（2017-present）、《フリースタイルダンジョン/Freestyle Dungeon》（2015-2020）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的书：</span></strong><span><br>《ミュージック・マガジン（Music Magazine）》2017年6月号 ：</span><a href="http://musicmagazine.jp/mm/mm201706.html" data-url="http://musicmagazine.jp/mm/mm201706.html"><span>【特集】日本のヒップホップ・アルバム・ベスト100</span></a><span><br>《ミュージック・マガジン（Music Magazine）》2023年12月号 ：</span><a href="http://musicmagazine.jp/mm/mm202312.html" data-url="http://musicmagazine.jp/mm/mm202312.html"><span>【特集】 日本のヒップホップはここまで来た！2023</span></a><span><br>《ユリイカ (EUREKA)》2023年5月号：</span><a href="http://www.seidosha.co.jp/