    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>谈话人（按出场顺序）：耳田 a.k.a. mimida/10000/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65890c9a1bee258b2a4bea0f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65890c9a1bee258b2a4bea0f"><span>陆晓明</span></a><span>/Spooky</span></p><span></span><p><span>《town-B radio》是一档只对谈话人的交流快感负责的音乐聊天节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>三月做这个主题，你咪话我老𠹌土。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这回我们特别请来了电子舞曲文化品牌</span><a href="https://shypeople.cn/" data-url="https://shypeople.cn/"><span>ShyPeople</span></a><span>的创建者兼主理人10000，以及音乐行业从业者、资深电子乐迷</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/people/neuromancer/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/people/neuromancer/"><span>Spooky</span></a><span>，大家推荐/聊一聊由Roland公司生产的贝斯合成器TB-303〜acid house延伸出来的音乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>三月三听303，开运辟邪除病消灾。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐片段：</span></strong><span><br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> Phuture - Acid Tracks<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> Mantronix - Bassline<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a> Underground Resistance - Jupiter Jazz<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1156">19:16</a> Leftfield - Song Of Life<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a> Electronic Experienced - No. 303<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> Aphex Twin - Digeridoo<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">32:41</a> Aphex Twin - Start As You Mean To Go On<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2196">36:36</a> Moby - James Bond Theme (Moby's Re-Version)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2343">39:03</a> Josh Wink - Back In Tha' Day<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a> Beyond - 無事無事<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2607">43:27</a> 佚明 - 人山人海 (2003 Live)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2975">49:35</a> 何静 - 喜欢你 Remix<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> 何静 - 喜欢你<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3566">59:26</a> 黎明 - 全日愛<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3796">63:16</a> チームしゃちほこ - いいくらし<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4138">68:58</a> Negicco - Space Nekojaracy<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4434">73:54</a> ZOMBIE-CHANG - GOLD TRANCE<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4618">76:58</a> Aaliyah - Try Again<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4834">80:34</a> HVL - Alien Discotheque<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4974">82:54</a> Cignol - The Observable Universe<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5201">86:41</a> Devoye - Edits Vol. 1 - We Got Time (50's Acid Refix)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5484">91:24</a> 1OO1O x Eric Uh - Acid Playero</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>由于时间关系（录了三个小时）被忍痛删掉或预选后最终没能塞进去的歌曲：</span></strong><br><span>耳田 a.k.a. mimida：Charanjit Singh - Raga Bhairavi、Peggy Gou - It Makes You Forget (Itgehane)</span></p><span></span><p><span>10000：Larry Heard Presents Mr. White - The Sun Can't Compare</span></p><span></span><p><span>Spooky：A Guy Called Gerald - Voodoo Ray、F.U.S.E - Slac</span></p><span></span><p><span>陆晓明：Autechre - Kalpol Introl</span></p><span></span><p><span>（怕自己讲话太丧没来的）红房の选：Plastikman - Musik、Fatboy Slim、Daft Punk</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的书：</span></strong><span><br>Martin James《</span><a href="https://velocitypress.uk/product/state-of-bass/" data-url="https://velocitypress.uk/product/state-of-bass/"><span>State of Bass: The Origins of Jungle/Drum &amp; Bass</span></a><span>》<br>Ben Murphy &amp; Carl Loben《</span><a href="http://jawbonepress.com/renegade-snares/" data-url="http://jawbonepress.com/renegade-snares/"><span>Renegade Snares: The Resistance and Resilience of Drum &amp; Bass</span></a><span>》<br>Matt Anniss《</span><a href="https://velocitypress.uk/product/join-the-future-book/" data-url="https://velocitypress.uk/product/join-the-future-book/"><span>Join The Future: Bleep Techno and the Birth of British Bass Music</span></a><span>》（提到这本书的部分被剪掉了，但这本讲bleep techno始末的书很推荐）</spa