    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>谈话人</span></strong><span>（按出场顺序）：耳田 a.k.a. mimida/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6074f1f632a9048b0b89d16c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6074f1f632a9048b0b89d16c"><span>redhousepainter</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c"><span>大胃麒麟</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65890c9a1bee258b2a4bea0f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65890c9a1bee258b2a4bea0f"><span>陆晓明</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《town-B radio》是一档只对谈话人的交流快感负责的音乐聊天节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>终于来到2023年盘点的最终回。</span></p><span></span><p><span>进入5个半小时的最后阶段，大家都筋疲力尽，红房和耳田还双双喝到了失去记忆，但是竟然也录完了，「地狱马拉松」の奇迹。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐片段</span></strong><span>：<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> Micah Shemaiah &amp; Little Lion Sound - Jamaica Jamaica<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 7FO - Healing Swords<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">10:32</a> 尹相杰 - 这就是俗人<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> Maë Defays - High Tide<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">17:37</a> Maë Defays - Mangrove<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 耳田的中学同学 - 泸沽湖<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a> 麻园诗人 - 泸沽湖<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1637">27:17</a> 孙露 - 不让我的眼泪陪我过夜<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">31:04</a> 袁宁 - 远方的我在等着你八一送百合<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a> 小乐哥 - 执迷不悟（DJ版）<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2177">36:17</a> SkiAggu - MAXIMUM RIZZ<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">37:31</a> Brutalismus 3000 - DIE LIEBE KOMMT NICHT AUS BERLIN<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2645">44:05</a> Oilly Wallace - Time Has Flown<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2851">47:31</a> Cyrille Aimée - Beautiful Way<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3105">51:45</a> Dorota Miśkiewicz - Nucę, gwiżdżę sobie<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3247">54:07</a> Dorota Miśkiewicz &amp; Toninho Horta - Nucę, gwiżdżę sobie (Canto Canto)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3447">57:27</a> Alulu Paranhos &amp; Camões - Quando a Gente Brinca<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3673">61:13</a> 兴趣使然 - 兴趣使然的KTVIII（Disc1）<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4064">67:44</a> No-Man - Days in the Trees (Mahler)<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4228">70:28</a> George Clanton - I Been Young<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4531">75:31</a> Aphex Twin - #17<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4578">76:18</a> Brendan Eder Ensemble - #17<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5008">83:28</a> Caroline Polachek - Welcome to My Island<br><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5129">85:29</a> 陈明 - 寂寞让我如此美丽</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>由于时间关系最终没能塞进去的预选歌曲</span></strong><span>：<br>耳田 a.k.a. mimida：Wallace - Whirl、Kyle Hall - Ground Up Dub、Caterina Barbieri - Math of You、Lee "Scratch" Perry, Bob Riddim &amp; Xana Romeo - Police And Thieves、Jack Johnson &amp; Lee "Scratch" Perry - Traffic In The Sky (Lee “Scratch” Perry Dub)、EarthKry - The Ghetto、Natsu Summer - Think of Summer、NewJeans - ETA、Ive - Off The Record</span></p><span></span><p><span>大胃麒麟：MrDougDoug - I Am Sitting in a Cloud、Zheani - The Spiritual Meat Grinder、Brainfreeze - Brainwreck! EP、7038634357 - Neo Seven、bod[包家巷] - Music for Film01</span></p><span></span><p><span>陆晓明：Holy Tongue - Threshing Floor、大象体操（Elephant Gym） - Name</span></p><span></span><p><span>redhousepainter：（无）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的书</span></strong><span>：<br>MR White Label《Drexciya: Veinte mil surcos de techno submarino》<br>MR White Label《The Wizard: Contacto Techno》<br>MR White Label《R&amp;S Records: El Ferrari de doce pulgadas》<br>MR White Label《Andrew Weatherall: La quintaesencia de la electrónica》<br>MR White Label《DJ Hell: No hay límites》<br>大和田俊之+长谷川町藏《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35929102/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35929102/"><span>别再问我什么是嘻哈②</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>录完节目后，耳田还是买下了MR White Label那三本只发行了实体版的西班牙语书，并打算端着手机用Google Translate把它们啃掉：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FklHrglkb8uBmZLq568qsKF3csUE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Logo设计：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61b9e86b1eba486fee88ad9c"><span>大胃麒麟</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>合作联系：idmimida@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
